{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321531001:0":{"text":"你们刚刚说的话我都听见了，没想到六瓣蓝绒花居然还有这样的意义。","source_cn":"你们刚刚说的话我都听见了，没想到六瓣蓝绒花居然还有这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E4D2C35363FF54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321531002:1":{"text":"难怪在白山公国这样寒冷的地方，繁花原野的六瓣蓝绒花还能开得这么茂盛……这都是战士们的灵魂在庇护我们。","source_cn":"难怪在白山公国这样寒冷的地方，繁花原野的六瓣蓝绒花还能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA7F9807DE6EDFC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321531003:1":{"text":"两位，我现在终于明白了你们所说的“考古”的意义。这和盗墓完全不一样。","source_cn":"两位，我现在终于明白了你们所说的“考古”的意义。这和盗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B48D953F565086F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321531004:1":{"text":"同样是挖开坟墓，盗墓贼是为了倒卖文物，但考古却是为了研究历史，挖掘那些不为人知的故事。","source_cn":"同样是挖开坟墓，盗墓贼是为了倒卖文物，但考古却是为了研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB80EDFA14C264086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321531005:1":{"text":"唉，是啊……要不是你们，这些蓝绒花的故事恐怕永远都不会被人知道，那我们那些老祖宗的鲜血简直白流了！","source_cn":"唉，是啊……要不是你们，这些蓝绒花的故事恐怕永远都不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FDAD9AB5995752B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321531006:0":{"text":"没错，这就是盗墓和考古的区别！","source_cn":"没错，这就是盗墓和考古的区别！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9924783073485AA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321531007:0":{"text":"除了金银珠宝，每一件藏在角落里毫不起眼的东西，对考古学家来说都是有意义的。尤其是那些记录着文字和图画的文物，它们是最称职的历史诉说者！","source_cn":"除了金银珠宝，每一件藏在角落里毫不起眼的东西，对考古学...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72CBCADDB42B1052","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321531008:0":{"text":"将它们保护起来，把它们所象征的故事公之于众，让历史不断传承下去，这就是考古的意义。","source_cn":"将它们保护起来，把它们所象征的故事公之于众，让历史不断...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE421722ACFD66F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321531009:1":{"text":"非常抱歉，之前误解了两位。","source_cn":"非常抱歉，之前误解了两位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5337400F3436C6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321531010:1":{"text":"等我回去后，一定会教训手下的卫兵和雇佣兵，让他们尊重各位前来考古的学者。","source_cn":"等我回去后，一定会教训手下的卫兵和雇佣兵，让他们尊重各...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15C5DFF29A8AA77D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321531011:0":{"text":"唉……之前的事真是对不住。","source_cn":"唉……之前的事真是对不住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3443F6722388633C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321531012:0":{"text":"不过你们放心，我以后肯定不会再把考古学家和盗墓贼弄混了！","source_cn":"不过你们放心，我以后肯定不会再把考古学家和盗墓贼弄混了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0E7F4BA6B66613E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321531013:0":{"text":"算了，也没什么大不了的。在考古这条艰难的求索之路上，被人误解也是在所难免的。","source_cn":"算了，也没什么大不了的。在考古这条艰难的求索之路上，被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF347D15E92D83651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321531014:1":{"text":"正如两位学者所说，这快石板对白山公国的意义无可比拟。我会派人将它送往雪松镇，申请由专业人员来保护它，并且将这上面的传说公之于众。","source_cn":"正如两位学者所说，这快石板对白山公国的意义无可比拟。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17172F47C8D020CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321531015:0":{"text":"谢谢您，卫队长，这正是我们希望看到的！","source_cn":"谢谢您，卫队长，这正是我们希望看到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC32FCA1BB761B474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321531016:1":{"text":"如果不介意的话，两位学者也可以留在白山公国，对这里的遗迹进行发掘和保护。我会向罗德里戈侍卫长汇报，让他为两位安排生活起居所需的一切。","source_cn":"如果不介意的话，两位学者也可以留在白山公国，对这里的遗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96C90DE7A1D80999","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321531017:0":{"text":"这个嘛……我们需要考虑一下，也得征求学会的同意才行。","source_cn":"这个嘛……我们需要考虑一下，也得征求学会的同意才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F896953BEAADB17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321531018:0":{"text":"无论能不能留下来，只要有越来越多的人能理解考古这份工作的意义，我和梅丽莎的努力就得到了回……回报！阿嚏！","source_cn":"无论能不能留下来，只要有越来越多的人能理解考古这份工作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AE923D30B3EF11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321531019:0":{"text":"……伽利，你又开始过敏了！还是赶快离开这片花海吧！","source_cn":"……伽利，你又开始过敏了！还是赶快离开这片花海吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AF2F27E16E0241","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321531020:0":{"text":"唔……我没事的。再说花粉过敏也不全是坏事！","source_cn":"唔……我没事的。再说花粉过敏也不全是坏事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED77C448F20ABA0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:13215